quran[7]{c,v,t}:
  8,34,What (other excuse) do they have that Allah should not punish them while they are barring (the believers) from the Sacred Mosque when they are not its (rightful) custodians? Its (rightful) custodians are only those who are God-conscious. But most of them do not know.
  8,35,"Their prayer at the (Sacred) House is only whistling and clapping. So, taste the punishment for what you used to disbelieve in."
  8,36,"Indeed, those who disbelieve, spend their wealth to hinder (people) from the way of Allah. And they will keep on spending it; then it will be a source of regret for them, then they shall be overcome. And the disbelievers shall be gathered towards Hell,"
  8,37,"so that Allah may separate the evil from the good, and make the evil (dominating) one upon another, then pile them up altogether, and place them in Hell. It is they who are the losers."
  8,38,"Say to the disbelievers: ‘If they stop (their transgression), what has already passed shall be forgiven for them. But if they repeat the same, then the precedent of the ancients has already passed (before them).’"
  8,39,"And fight them (against their aggression) until there is no more persecution and the religion becomes totally (free) in compliance with Allah’s command (of peace and justice). And if they abstain (from causing terror and disorder), then Allah is indeed All-Seeing of whatever they do."
  8,40,"And if they turn away (from complying with Allah’s command), then know that Allah is your Protector—an Excellent Protector and an Excellent Helper!"
